ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 446 Tm
(1. Simulator emits multi-device KPIs \(latency, packet loss, CPU, interface util, error) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 433 Tm
(   rates\) at high rate into Kafka topics.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 420 Tm
