ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 368 Tm
(4. On anomaly/forecast breach -> Alert Router \(email + Slack\) + RAG RCA \(retrieve) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 355 Tm
(   runbooks/topology + LLM explanation\).) Tj
