1 0 0 1 54 360 Tm
(10. Design Choices for Large Simulated Data) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 341 Tm
(- Kafka partitions aligned with device cardinality for parallel consumers.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 328 Tm
(- Batch writes \(COPY / multi-row INSERT\), compression on topics.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 315 Tm
(- Continuous aggregates instead of raw scans for executive UI.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 302 Tm
(- Separate online inference path from offline training path.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 289 Tm
(- Resource quotas in K8s so simulator cannot starve ML/API pods.) Tj
ET
BT
